      "en": "But you are cast away from your tomb like an abominable branch, clothed with the slain who are thrust through with the sword, who go down to the stones of the pit; like a dead body trodden under foot.",
      "ko": "오직 너는 자기 무덤에서 내어쫓겼으니 가증한 나무가지 같고 칼에 찔려 돌구덩이에 빠진 주검에 둘려싸였으니 밟힌 시체와 같도다",
      "source_text_hash": "65b2d7546af9051645e341dca1e07184ace5ba2441279c44c135e0071445b58a",
      "translation_text_hash": "6ee3ad5d2dce0443697a703f313a05d035bd1c72b669dcaf8239d20ad12bf7cc",
