      "en": "The LORD of Armies has sworn, saying, “Surely, as I have thought, so shall it happen; and as I have purposed, so shall it stand:",
      "ko": "만군의 여호와께서 맹세하여 가라사대 나의 생각한 것이 반드시 되며 나의 경영한 것이 반드시 이루리라",
      "source_text_hash": "5dbaaf67fe8813d04323fb5364172e41bdefc5b88ea9dfc97a1e3fcc8f6a5396",
