      "en": "For the LORD of Armies has planned, and who can stop it? His hand is stretched out, and who can turn it back?”",
      "ko": "만군의 여호와께서 경영하셨은즉 누가 능히 그것을 폐하며 그 손을 펴셨은즉 누가 능히 그것을 돌이키랴",
      "source_text_hash": "c52e23335dad8abf02b7a95c015e65338cba64ba8e52ce4a8ee830242e9663ef",
